       boolean hasEmail = owner.getEmail() != null && !owner.getEmail().isEmpty();
       return (noNamesakes && hasEmail) ? "SILVER" : "BRONZE";
   }
   ```

The null-safe checks mirror the surrounding mapper code so owners without a namesake count or email serialize as `BRONZE` cleanly.

